# Diagnostic, not a receipt: the frame intervals the display period is read
# from (physics catalog plan, 2026-10-04, "Infer the period"), logged four
# times while the layout moves, to fit offline. Run on the 300-node page
# (?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=max) and on a light
# one (?nodes=24&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=max).
assert snap ready == true
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 6
log-pace first
log-intervals first
settle 6
log-intervals second
settle 6
log-intervals third
settle 6
log-pace fourth
log-intervals fourth
log diag display period complete
